      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is valid; clinging to anything when everything feels hollow is an immense drain. If the big picture of meaning has dissolved, please allow yourself the grace to stop fighting the weight of it for a while. Sometimes, the only necessary action is simply to let the performance drop, to give yourself permission to rest in the quiet space of the void. There is no obligation to keep holding up a structure that has crumbled.",
